  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Vitalization of COLEPS System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish the best user centric e-Procurement system that provides an effective one-stop and mobile public e-procurement portal (Single Window) through national and international interoperability&#xce74;&#xba54;&#xb8ec; &#xc804;&#xc790;&#xc870;&#xb2ec;&#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c;&#xc758; &#xc0c1;&#xd638; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xc131; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1; &#xbc0f; &#xc870;&#xb2ec;&#xd589;&#xc815; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xc218;&#xc6d0;&#xad6d; &#xc815;&#xbd80;&#xc758; &#xacf5;&#xacf5;&#xc870;&#xb2ec; &#xd504;&#xb85c;&#xb808;&#xc2a4; &#xd22c;&#xba85;&#xd654;, &#xc815;&#xbcf4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xc81c;&#xace0; &#xb4f1;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc218;&#xc6d0;&#xad6d; &#xbc1c;&#xc804;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xae30;&#xc5ec;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To introduce a user-centered electronic procurement system that provides an effective one-stop function and mobile electronic procurement portal, the Cameroon electronic procurement system expands accessibility and usability at home and abroad, and supports human capacity improvement for efficient system operation</narrative>
  </description>
